From e0f1e5cb8100672ec8a722f7f3838e1029204f87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:14:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] LCD: tu quay ve MOI QUET THE sau khi xong viec, bao LCD
 khi quet the ma khong chay duoc

- Them LCD_IDLE_SECONDS (mac dinh 5, 0 = tat): XE VAO OK / XE RA OK / the bi tu choi tu ve trang thai san sang
- Thong bao can nhan vien (lech vi tri, cho nhan vien, khong khop, tu choi, loi) van giu nguyen
- Quet the khi camera chua co hinh -> LOI CAMERA; khi OCR chua nap xong -> DANG KHOI DONG (truoc day LCD im lang)
- Them test, cap nhat README va .env.example
